# Tapza Care

Follow the canonical project guidance in AGENTS.md, docs/ai/PROJECT_BRIEF.md, and the relevant architecture/implementation document before making changes.

- Use Expo managed workflow.
- Keep Expo Router routes in src/app and keep route files thin.
- Use npm only and do not add dependencies without a clear reason.
- Do not implement feature work outside the current phase.
- Preserve strict TypeScript, no implicit any, and no project-wide rule weakening.
- Keep changes limited to the requested phase and update AI_LOG.md after validation.
